The future looks grim indeed… for your foes.

You can target a creature affected by Bleak Outcome to consume up to [3, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] stacks, dealing [12, 16, 20, 22, 25 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage to it for every stack and increasing your Spellpower by 4 per stacks for 6 turns.

While powered-up you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.

Damage is based on your Spellpower.
